#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:106
msgid "clear-record: from many recordings to one clear record."
msgstr "clear-record：从众多录音到一份清晰的记录。"

# Per-option help: left English on purpose (the terminal is not the
# interface).
#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:109
msgid ""
"raise diagnostics log detail (the flag form of CR_LOG_LEVEL=debug); the "
"log is written to the app state directory, never to stdout"
msgstr ""

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:238
msgid ""
"Machine-local verb: `synth`, `backends`, `bench` and `diagnose` take the "
"machine you are running them on as their subject, never the node, and are"
" deliberately not facades — routed through a node, `backends` would "
"silently answer about the node's machine instead of yours."
msgstr ""
"本机命令：`synth`、`backends`、`bench` 和 `diagnose` "
"的主题是你运行它们的这台机器，而不是节点；它们刻意不做成门面 —— 若经由节点转发，`backends` "
"会悄悄回答节点所在的那台机器，而不是你的。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:304
msgid ""
"--split-channels and --mix-down are mutually exclusive; pass one or "
"neither."
msgstr "--split-channels 与 --mix-down 互斥；只能二选一，或都不指定。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:320
msgid "--diarize and --no-diarize are mutually exclusive; pass one or neither."
msgstr "--diarize 与 --no-diarize 互斥；只能二选一，或都不指定。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:340
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{path} is a file, not a directory: this command expects a directory of "
"audio files."
msgstr "「{path}」是文件而不是目录：本命令需要一个包含音频文件的目录。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:706
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"[auto] the recommended model {model!r} is not in the models directory, "
"and --auto never downloads one.\n"
"  Pre-fetch it, e.g. `hf download ggerganov/whisper.cpp ggml-{model}.bin "
"--local-dir {models_dir}`, or pass an explicit `--model`."
msgstr ""
"[auto] 推荐模型 {model!r} 不在模型目录中，而 --auto 从不下载模型。\n"
"  请预先下载，例如 `hf download ggerganov/whisper.cpp ggml-{model}.bin --local-"
"dir {models_dir}`，或显式指定 `--model`。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:850
msgid ""
"clear-record's work needs a node, and this command could not start one; "
"start one with `clear-record serve`, or from the tray app — `serve` "
"writes its log to the diagnostics sink"
msgstr ""
"clear-record 的工作需要节点，而本命令无法启动节点；请用 `clear-record serve` 启动一个，或从托盘应用启动 —— "
"`serve` 会把日志写入诊断接收器"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:864
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"a node started as pid {pid} but this command cannot reach it; it is left "
"running, and its log is in the diagnostics sink"
msgstr "节点已以进程 {pid} 启动，但本命令无法访问它；该进程保持运行，其日志位于诊断接收器"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:979
#, python-brace-format
msgid "the node is listening at {url}"
msgstr "节点正在监听 {url}"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:1159
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"a node run cannot set {flags} yet: it runs with what the node's run API "
"declares, and nothing is dropped"
msgstr "节点运行尚不能设置 {flags}：它只按节点运行 API 声明的参数执行，不会丢弃任何选项"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:1284
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"[next] the record is in {directory}/export; review it and accept the "
"minutes in the console: `clear-record web`"
msgstr "[下一步] 记录位于 {directory}/export；请在控制台中审阅并接受会议纪要：`clear-record web`"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:1368
msgid ""
"run the pipeline and report transcript quality against a reference if "
"given"
msgstr "运行流水线，并在给定参考文本时报告转写质量"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:1383
msgid "assign speaker labels to already-transcribed segments"
msgstr "为已转写的片段分配说话人标签"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:1390
msgid "re-attribute speakers by relative source energy (close-mic cross-talk)"
msgstr "按相对声源能量重新归属说话人（近距麦克风串音）"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:1397
msgid "show or append to the workspace glossary (ASR initial prompt)"
msgstr "显示或追加工作区术语表（ASR 初始提示词）"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:1404
msgid ""
"generate a clean scene + degraded per-device recordings with exact ground"
" truth"
msgstr "生成干净场景 + 各设备的降质录音，并提供精确的标准答案"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:1411
msgid "list which ASR backends are currently available"
msgstr "列出当前可用的 ASR 后端"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/cli.py:1417
msgid "print where the running node is listening, and whether it answers"
msgstr "打印正在运行的节点所监听的地址，并检查它是否响应"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/cli/runs.py:263
#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/_activity_run.html:18
#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/_settings_status.html:22
#, python-brace-format
msgid "position {n}"
msgstr "第 {n} 位"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/core/node.py:114
msgid ""
"no clear-record node is listening; start one with `clear-record serve`, "
"or from the tray app"
msgstr "没有 clear-record 节点在监听；请用 `clear-record serve` 启动一个，或从托盘应用启动"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/core/paths.py:190
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"clear-record: adopting the existing pre-platformdirs {label} directory at"
" {legacy}; move it to {native} for the platform-native layout "
"(ADR-0025).{hint}"
msgstr ""
"clear-record：正在沿用 platformdirs 之前已有的 {label} 目录 {legacy}；请将其移动到 {native} "
"以使用平台原生布局（ADR-0025）。{hint}"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/core/paths.py:365
msgid " Set CR_MODELS_DIR to pin a different models directory."
msgstr " 设置 CR_MODELS_DIR 可指定其他模型目录。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/core/scope.py:62
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"cannot read {token!r} in re-run range {whole!r}: expected H:MM, H:MM:SS "
"or seconds (e.g. 12:30-18:00)."
msgstr "无法读取重跑范围 {whole!r} 中的 {token!r}：应为 H:MM、H:MM:SS 或秒数（例如 12:30-18:00）。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/core/scope.py:76
#, python-brace-format
msgid "minutes must be under 60 in {whole!r} ({token!r})."
msgstr "{whole!r}（{token!r}）中的分钟数必须小于 60。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/core/scope.py:86
#, python-brace-format
msgid "minutes/seconds must be under 60 in {whole!r} ({token!r})."
msgstr "{whole!r}（{token!r}）中的分钟/秒数必须小于 60。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/core/scope.py:102
msgid "re-run range is empty."
msgstr "重跑范围为空。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/core/scope.py:107
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"cannot read re-run range {whole!r}: expected START-END (e.g. 12:30-18:00 "
"or 745-1050)."
msgstr "无法读取重跑范围 {whole!r}：应为 START-END（例如 12:30-18:00 或 745-1050）。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/core/scope.py:117
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"re-run range {whole!r} ends at or before it starts; the end must be later"
" than the start."
msgstr "重跑范围 {whole!r} 的结束时间不晚于开始时间；结束必须晚于开始。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/pipeline/auto.py:141
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"--backend auto: chose {backend!r} — first available in the native-first "
"preference order ({candidates}); available here: {here}."
msgstr ""
"--backend auto：选择了 "
"{backend!r}——原生优先偏好顺序（{candidates}）中的第一个可用项；此处可用：{here}。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/pipeline/auto.py:155
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"no ASR backend is available on this machine; `--backend auto` found none "
"of: {backends}.\n"
"  Install a system `whisper-cli` + a ggml GPU plugin (on macOS, `brew "
"install whisper-cpp`; on Linux, e.g. a distro `whisper-cpp` plus `ggml-"
"cuda`/`ggml-vulkan`; see docs/adr/0005), or pass an explicit `--backend "
"<id>`."
msgstr ""
"此机器上没有可用的 ASR 后端；`--backend auto` 在以下项中一个也没找到：{backends}。\n"
"  请安装系统级 `whisper-cli` 和一个 ggml GPU 插件（macOS 上执行 `brew install whisper-"
"cpp`；Linux 上例如发行版的 `whisper-cpp` 加 `ggml-cuda`/`ggml-vulkan`；参见 "
"docs/adr/0005），或显式传入 `--backend <id>`。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/pipeline/auto.py:230
