#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/_settings_status.html:52
msgid ""
"A token authenticates the machine API (/api/v1) for a script, with no "
"browser and no cookie. It is shown once when it is minted and stored only"
" as a hash; revoking it takes effect on the very next request, with no "
"restart. A token cannot open the console, cannot mint or revoke tokens, "
"and cannot destroy anything — the machine API has no verb that destroys "
"what a durable copy cannot reconstruct."
msgstr ""
"令牌让脚本无需浏览器、无需 Cookie 即可通过机器 "
"API（/api/v1）认证。它只在生成时显示一次，并且只以哈希形式存储；撤销它会在下一次请求时立即生效，无需重启。令牌无法打开控制台，无法生成或撤销令牌，也无法销毁任何东西——机器"
" API 没有任何会销毁“无法从持久副本重建的数据”的动词。"

