#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/agent.html:11
msgid ""
"Point at an MCP harness, register clear-record's MCP server, then run the"
" hello-world acceptance test. clear-record holds no model and asks for no"
" key — your harness does the model work. Every step is skippable; you can"
" return here from Settings or Setup."
msgstr ""
"指向一个 MCP 宿主，注册 clear-record 的 MCP 服务器，然后运行 hello-world 验收测试。clear-record "
"自身不持有模型，也不索取密钥 —— 模型工作由你的宿主完成。每一步都可跳过；你可以随时从「设置」或「初始设置」回到这里。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/agent.html:16
msgid "Back to setup"
msgstr "返回初始设置"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/auth.html:23
msgid "Set the console password"
msgstr "设置控制台密码"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/auth.html:24
msgid ""
"Nothing else on this console is usable until a password is set. It is the"
" one credential this node checks: the console and its API need it, the "
"registry stores only a salted hash of it, and the password itself is "
"never written to a file, a log or a bundle."
msgstr ""
"在设置密码之前，此控制台的其他任何内容都无法使用。它是本节点校验的唯一凭据：控制台及其 API "
"都需要它，注册表中只保存它的加盐哈希，而密码本身绝不写入文件、日志或诊断包。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/auth.html:26
