#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/setup.html:15
msgid ""
"Setup is system readiness: get clear-record from installed to usable. "
"Every step can be skipped — you can return whenever you like."
msgstr "初始设置关乎系统就绪：让 clear-record 从「已安装」变为「可使用」。每一步都可以跳过——你随时可以回来。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/setup.html:17
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"clear-record was updated to {version}. Walk the steps again to check the "
"system still works."
msgstr "clear-record 已更新到 {version}。请重新走一遍这些步骤，确认系统仍然正常。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/setup.html:23
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "欢迎"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/setup.html:25
msgid ""
"clear-record records, transcribes and reviews meetings locally. Your own "
"tape becomes a transcript under Projects → Meetings, and — once a harness"
" is connected — drafts under that meeting's review, and minutes under "
"that project's Minutes. Nothing here is required before you start; this "
"path gets transcription ready, connects an MCP harness, and ends with an "
"acceptance test."
msgstr ""
"clear-record 在本地录制、转写并审阅会议。你自己的录音会在「项目 → "
"会议」下变成转写文本；连接宿主后，还会在该会议的审阅区生成草稿，并在该项目的「纪要」下生成纪要。开始前无需完成任何步骤；这条路径会让转写就绪、连接"
" MCP 宿主，并以一次验收测试收尾。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/setup.html:27
msgid "Next: Transcription"
msgstr "下一步：转写"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/setup.html:38
msgid ""
"Register clear-record with your MCP harness. This is the same panel as "
"Settings → Agent; there is only one."
msgstr "把 clear-record 注册到你的 MCP 宿主。这与「设置 → 智能体」是同一个面板，只有这一个。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/setup.html:44
msgid "Next: Try it"
msgstr "下一步：试一下"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/setup.html:53
msgid ""
"The acceptance test this path ends on: a hello-world tape through "
"transcription, shown back as the transcript an MCP agent receives. Run it"
" in the Agent step's Try it stage, or from Settings → Status."
msgstr ""
"这条路径最终要完成的验收测试：一段 hello-world 录音经过转写，再按 MCP "
"智能体收到的那样显示回转写文本。可在「智能体」一步的「试一下」环节运行，或在「设置 → 状态」中运行。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/setup.html:55
msgid "Run it in the Agent step"
msgstr "在「智能体」一步中运行"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/setup.html:58
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "完成初始设置"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/templates/setup.html:61
msgid "Dismiss setup"
msgstr "忽略初始设置"

